From f7f3b9fbe77707aa54bb2bf683fa35f612f2bc14 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: workspace-agent <workspace.vm.agent@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 08:09:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 38/59] m3 particles: clampTailParts cuts tails to the distance
 travelled

PAR_ flags 0x40000 (clampTailParts): a tail never reaches farther than
its particle has moved since birth (WhiteoutFlakes StepAnalytic). Before,
every clamped beam was drawn at full length from birth, so light shafts
stuck out far past their emitters.

Adds particleMotion() (birth point and speed) for the tests.

Known defects:
- Rule ported from WhiteoutFlakes; not compared with the game.
---
 src/viewer/handlers/m3/handler.ts        |  6 +++--
 src/viewer/handlers/m3/particlerender.ts | 29 ++++++++++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 31 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

